<<~ ahu slot=`#/head`>>

! engine.residency.resolves ~ residency inspection: every manifestation and the bag that wins

`lares wiki resolve <tiddler-uri>` asks the daemon for every manifestation of the tiddler across bags, its change ids and tombstones, and marks the bag that wins by recipe priority and what it hides. Neither manifestation nor tombstone exits 5. Needs a standing vessel.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/shows`>>

!! shows ~ resolve

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`example` name=`resolve` params=`tiddler-uri/lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/api/pono/affordance ~ every manifestation of a title`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/takes`>>

!! takes ~ tiddler-uri

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`arg` name=`tiddler-uri` params=`takes/title needs/required seat/1 as/<tiddler-uri> ~ the tiddler's title`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/gate`>>

!! gate ~ vessel

Testimony: the door checks; this slot grants nothing.

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`gate` name=`vessel` params=`who/seat-or-hand ~ the daemon verb runs under the vessel's own did; this handler checks no ocap of its own`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/refuses`>>

!! refuses ~ usage · daemon-refused

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`usage` params=`cure/[[engine.residency.resolves tiddler-uri/lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/api/pono/affordance]] ~ name the tiddler`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`daemon-refused` params=`~ the daemon's resolve verb refused; its message rides the line, exit 4`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/answers`>>

!! answers ~ resolved · absent

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`band` name=`resolved` params=`exit/0 fields/[[manifestations tombstones winningBag hiddenBy]] ~ the manifestations and the winner`>>
<<has entity=`band` name=`absent` params=`exit/5 ~ no bag holds the title, live or tombstoned`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

