!! skins ~ cli

<<~ ahu slot=`#/skins/cli`>>

!!! lares wiki resolve

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`skin` name=`cli` params=`handler/host spells/[[lares wiki resolve]] ~ the terminal`>>
```

